BioFasting - is a library that is intended to replace the existing one called "BioPython" because of its slow performance.

First step of creating library is: List all of existing classes/methods/functions/constants and analyze them. 
                                   find weaknesses and factors that are slowing down performance or effect it
                                   in any other way.

Second Phase is: Create a repo with list of issues and to start solving one-by-one
